## Summary
Photos have emerged from a yacht meeting attended by Genoa's mayor Marco Bucci and port authority president Paolo Signorini. Attendees left their mobile phones outside to ensure their private conversations remained confidential.

## Key Points
- Photos from a yacht gathering have been released showing private meetings among Italian officials
- Genova mayor Marco Bucci and port authority president Paolo Signorini were among the guests
- Cell phones were left outside to prevent recording of the private conversations


